OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be mainly dry and cloudy
OL,8,Falthough a little light rain will
OL,9,Fextend east for a time.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMost of the dry will be dry,
OL,12,Fsome brighter spells along the east
OL,13,Fcoast. Rain will spread east later in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon and evening. Warm in any
OL,15,Fbrightness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
