OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FShowers, some heavy and thundery
OL,7,FTuesday. These clear in the east for a
OL,8,Ftime Wednesday. A band of heavy rain
OL,9,Fpushes southeast Wednesday night,
OL,10,Fturning showery Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
